  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 7.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif heora menn slean ure eahta, ðonne beoð hy utlage ge wið hy ge wið us, ⁊ ne beo nanre bote weorðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if their men slay eight of us, they shall be treated as outlaws both by them and by us, and shall not be allowed to settle the matter by any payment of compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et si homines eorum occidant pecuniam nostram, utlage sint apud illos et nos et non admittantur ad emdendationem.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
